["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasInput", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Build, DefinedProcess or Action element has each `to` Element as an input.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
